or anyone who values a peaceful night's sleep.\n\n🔄 **Flexible Second Room**\nCurrently set up with a bed, wardrobe, and desk – easily adapted as a guest room, home office, children's room, or dressing room. Your space, your rules.\n\n🍳 **Fully Equipped Kitchen**\nStove, oven, fridge, dishwasher, and ample storage – everything you need to cook and live comfortably.\n\n🌞 **Bright & Peaceful Atmosphere**\nLarge windows fill the apartment with natural light and create a calm, welcoming feel from day one.\n\n📍 **Great Location**\nWalking distance to the city center, with public transport, supermarkets, and the university close by.\n\n🚗 *Parking space or garage available separately – on request.*","facilities":{"airConditioning":{"value":"no"},"allergyFriendly":{"value":"no"},"balconyTerrace":{"value":"shared"},"basement":{"value":"private"},"bathroom":{"value":"private"},"bed":{"value":"yes"},"bedroomFurnished":{"value":"yes"},"bedroomLock":{"value":"yes"},"bedrooms":{"value":"2"},"closet":{"value":"yes"},"couplesAllowed":{"value":"yes"},"desk":{"value":"yes"},"dishwasher":{"value":"yes"},"dryer":{"value":"no"},"electricityCostIncluded":{"value":"no"},"flooring":{"value":"laminate"},"garden":{"value":"no"},"gasCostIncluded":{"value":"no"},"gender":{"value":"female"},"heating":{"value":"gas"},"internetCostIncluded":{"value":"no"},"kitchen":{"value":"private"},"kitchenware":{"value":"private"},"livingRoom":{"value":"private"},"parking":{"value":"private"},"pets":{"value":"discussable"},"playMusic":{"value":"discussable"},"registrationPossible":{"value":"yes"},"roomFurniture":{"value":"yes"},"smoking":{"value":"outside_only"},"tenantStatus":{"value":"working professionals only"},"toilet":{"value":"private"},"totalSize":{"value":"62"},"tv":{"value":"yes"},"washingMachine":{"value":"yes"},"waterCostIncluded":{"value":"no"},"wheelchairAccessible":{"value":"no"},"wifi":{"value":"yes"}},"costs":{"currency":"EUR","pricing":"monthly","price":78700,"deposit":200000,"agencyFee":0,"